## 方案二：使用云端OCR API（更准确但收费）

如果Tesseract识别率不够，可以接入成熟的OCR API：

### 1. 百度OCR API（免费额度）

```php
function recognizeImageWithBaidu($imageUrl) {
    // 下载图片
    $imageData = file_get_contents($imageUrl);
    $base64 = base64_encode($imageData);

    // 百度API配置
    $apiKey = '你的API_KEY';
    $secretKey = '你的SECRET_KEY';

    // 获取access_token
    $tokenUrl = "https://aip.baidubce.com/oauth/2.0/token?grant_type=client_credentials&client_id={$apiKey}&client_secret={$secretKey}";
    $tokenResp = json_decode(file_get_contents($tokenUrl), true);
    $accessToken = $tokenResp['access_token'];

    // 调用通用文字识别
    $url = "https://aip.baidubce.com/rest/2.0/ocr/v1/general_basic?access_token={$accessToken}";
    $ch = curl_init($url);
    curl_setopt($ch, CURLOPT_POST, true);
    curl_setopt($ch, CURLOPT_POSTFIELDS, http_build_query(['image' => $base64]));
    curl_setopt($ch, CURLOPT_RETURNTRANSFER, true);
    $response = curl_exec($ch);
    curl_close($ch);

    $result = json_decode($response, true);
    if (isset($result['words_result'])) {
        $texts = array_column($result['words_result'], 'words');
        return implode("\n", $texts);
    }
    return null;
}
```

### 2. OpenAI Vision API（最强但贵）

```php
function recognizeImageWithOpenAI($imageUrl) {
    $apiKey = '你的OPENAI_API_KEY';

    $ch = curl_init('https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions');
    $data = [
        'model' => 'gpt-4-vision-preview',
        'messages' => [
            [
                'role' => 'user',
                'content' => [
                    ['type' => 'text', 'text' => 'Extract all text from this image.'],
                    ['type' => 'image_url', 'image_url' => ['url' => $imageUrl]]
                ]
            ]
        ],
        'max_tokens' => 1000
    ];

    curl_setopt($ch, CURLOPT_HTTPHEADER, [
        'Content-Type: application/json',
        "Authorization: Bearer {$apiKey}"
    ]);
    curl_setopt($ch, CURLOPT_POST, true);
    curl_setopt($ch, CURLOPT_POSTFIELDS, json_encode($data));
    curl_setopt($ch, CURLOPT_RETURNTRANSFER, true);
    $response = curl_exec($ch);
    curl_close($ch);

    $result = json_decode($response, true);
    return $result['choices'][0]['message']['content'] ?? null;
}
```

